<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>紫水晶 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><description>Recent content in 紫水晶 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>射手座性格全解析：火象變動宮的真理探索與自由靈魂</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E9%9D%88%E9%AD%82/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E9%9D%88%E9%AD%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;射手座的符號是&lt;strong&gt;半人馬射出的箭&lt;/strong&gt;——一個一半是人、一半是馬的存在，正在把箭瞄向遠方。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>眉心輪完整指南：靛色第三眼開啟直覺洞察與內在智慧</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「&lt;strong&gt;第三眼&lt;/strong&gt;」是靈性圈最常被討論、也最容易被誤解的詞。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>雙魚座性格全解析：水象變動宮的夢境靈性與宇宙之愛</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A2%E5%A2%83%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%88%87%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A2%E5%A2%83%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%88%87%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;雙魚座是黃道十二宮的最後一個星座——這個位置不是隨便排的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪守護水晶速查表：每個脈輪該配什麼石頭最有感</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶療癒這幾年很紅——但很多人買了一堆水晶，卻不知道&lt;strong&gt;哪個對應哪個脈輪&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;該怎麼搭配&lt;/strong&gt;。買到對的水晶，能感覺能量明顯改變；買到不對的或亂配，效果就只是「漂亮」。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>水瓶座性格全解析：風象固定宮的創新前衛與人道精神</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%9B%E8%88%87%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%9B%E8%88%87%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水瓶座的中文名字常讓人誤會——以為「&lt;strong&gt;水瓶&lt;/strong&gt;」是水象星座。其實不是，水瓶座是&lt;strong&gt;風象星座&lt;/strong&gt;，符號的水瓶倒出的也不是水，是**「知識之水」**。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>頂輪完整指南：紫色冠之輪連結宇宙意識與靈性圓滿</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;七大脈輪走到最後，到了頭頂——這是**頂輪（Sahasrara, Crown Chakra）**所在的位置，也是整套能量地圖的盡頭。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶 x 眉心輪 &amp; 頂輪：一顆石頭，同時打開兩個靈性能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大多數水晶只對應一個脈輪。紫水晶不一樣——它同時連結眉心輪和頂輪，也就是七脈輪體系裡最頂端的兩個能量中心。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶功效完整解析：靈性修行入門首選</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在水晶店走了一圈，最後手裡還是捧著一顆紫水晶——你不孤單，幾乎每個人的起點都在這裡。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶怎麼用？冥想、助眠、空間淨化實戰完整指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;買了紫水晶，然後呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶星座配對：雙魚、水瓶、射手為什麼特別有緣？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%85%8D%E5%B0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%89%B9%E5%88%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%B7%A3/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%85%8D%E5%B0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%89%B9%E5%88%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%B7%A3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;同樣一顆紫水晶，有人戴了感覺渾身舒暢，有人帶了幾個月幾乎沒感覺。這不全然是「信不信的問題」——星座跟水晶的共振確實有差。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶淨化方法完整指南：月光浴、煙燻、聲音療癒怎麼選？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E6%B5%B4%E7%85%99%E7%87%BB%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E6%B5%B4%E7%85%99%E7%87%BB%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶需要淨化——這件事很多人知道，但真正做到的不多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>